#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"upgrade from the IBM Quantum Open Plan to an IBM Cloud Pay-As-You-Go Plan"
msgstr "upgrade dari IBM Quantum Open Plan ke IBM Cloud Pay-As-You-Go Plan"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrade from the Open Plan"
msgstr "Upgrade dari Open Plan"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrade from the Open Plan {#upgrade-from-the-open-plan}"
msgstr "Upgrade dari Open Plan {#upgrade-from-the-open-plan}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide is for entities who want to upgrade from the IBM Quantum&reg; "
"Open Plan to an IBM Cloud&reg; Pay-As-You-Go Plan. For instructions to set "
"up a cloud account, set up a service instance, and work with users, follow "
"these steps.\n"
msgstr ""
"Panduan ini ditujukan bagi organisasi atau individu yang ingin upgrade dari "
"IBM Quantum&reg; Open Plan ke IBM Cloud&reg; Pay-As-You-Go Plan. Untuk "
"instruksi menyiapkan akun cloud, membuat service instance, dan mengelola "
"pengguna, ikuti langkah-langkah berikut.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you are an individual setting up the service for the first time or if you"
" have been invited to an instance by an administrator, follow the steps in "
"[Install Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit) instead.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kalau Anda adalah individu yang baru pertama kali menyiapkan layanan ini, "
"atau sudah diundang ke instance oleh administrator, ikuti langkah-langkah di"
" [Install Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit) saja.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Before you begin {#before-you-begin}"
msgstr "Sebelum mulai {#before-you-begin}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If necessary, follow the steps in the [Set up to use IBM "
"Cloud](/guides/cloud-setup#cloud) section to complete the following:\n"
msgstr ""
"Kalau perlu, ikuti langkah-langkah di bagian [Set up to use IBM "
"Cloud](/guides/cloud-setup#cloud) untuk menyelesaikan hal berikut:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Sign up for an IBM Cloud account.\n"
msgstr "Daftar akun IBM Cloud.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Create an IBM Quantum instance.\n"
msgstr "Buat IBM Quantum instance.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"update-cloud-account\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"update-cloud-account\"></span>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrade your IBM Cloud account {#upgrade-your-ibm-cloud-account}"
msgstr "Upgrade akun IBM Cloud-mu {#upgrade-your-ibm-cloud-account}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Skip this if you already have an IBM Cloud Pay-as-you-go account. All new "
"IBM Cloud accounts are set up as Pay-as-you-go.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lewati bagian ini kalau Anda sudah punya akun IBM Cloud Pay-as-you-go. Semua"
" akun IBM Cloud baru sudah otomatis dibuat sebagai Pay-as-you-go.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You must upgrade your IBM Cloud account in the following circumstances:\n"
msgstr "Kamu perlu upgrade akun IBM Cloud dalam kondisi berikut:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "You have a Trial account.\n"
msgstr "Kamu punya akun Trial.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You have a Lite account (deprecated) that you created before 25 October "
"2021.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kamu punya akun Lite (sudah dihentikan) yang dibuat sebelum 25 Oktober "
"2021.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After you upgrade, you can continue to use any instances that you created "
"with your Lite account. To upgrade to a Pay-As-You-Go account, complete the "
"following steps:\n"
msgstr ""
"Setelah upgrade, Anda tetap bisa menggunakan instance yang sudah dibuat "
"dengan akun Lite-mu. Untuk upgrade ke akun Pay-As-You-Go, ikuti langkah-"
"langkah berikut:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Go to Manage > [Account](https://cloud.ibm.com/account) in the IBM Cloud "
"console.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pergi ke Manage > [Account](https://cloud.ibm.com/account) di IBM Cloud "
"console.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Select **Account settings**, and click **Add credit card**.\n"
msgstr "Pilih **Account settings**, lalu klik **Add credit card**.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Enter your payment information and click **Next** to submit your "
"information.\n"
msgstr ""
"Masukkan informasi pembayaranmu dan klik **Next** untuk mengirimkan "
"informasi.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After your payment information is processed, your account is upgraded.\n"
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"You will not be charged unless you create a Pay-As-You-Go Plan instance and use it to send workloads to QPUs.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Setelah informasi pembayaranmu diproses, akun Anda akan di-upgrade.\n"
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Kamu tidak akan dikenakan biaya kecuali kalau Anda membuat instance Pay-As-You-Go Plan dan menggunakannya untuk mengirim workload ke QPU.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Access your Pay-As-You-Go Plan {#access-your-pay-as-you-go-plan}"
msgstr "Akses Pay-As-You-Go Plan-mu {#access-your-pay-as-you-go-plan}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To use your IBM Cloud Pay-As-You-Go Plan, create a new "
"[instance](/guides/instances) and assign it to the Pay-As-You-Go Plan.  "
"<ins>All jobs sent to QPUs by specifying this instance will incur a "
"cost.</ins>  To use QPUs without incurring a cost, you must use an instance "
"assigned to the Open plan or other free plan, if you have one.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk menggunakan IBM Cloud Pay-As-You-Go Plan, buat "
"[instance](/guides/instances) baru dan tetapkan ke Pay-As-You-Go Plan.  "
"<ins>Semua job yang dikirim ke QPU dengan menggunakan instance ini akan "
"dikenakan biaya.</ins>  Untuk menggunakan QPU tanpa biaya, Anda harus "
"menggunakan instance yang ditetapkan ke Open plan atau paket gratis lainnya,"
" kalau Anda punya.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"It is recommended that you set up a [cost limit](/guides/manage-cost#cost-"
"limit) on the instance and learn about other ways to manage your cost when "
"using the Pay-As-You-Go Plan.\n"
msgstr ""
"Disarankan agar Anda menyiapkan [cost limit](/guides/manage-cost#cost-limit)"
" pada instance tersebut dan mempelajari cara lain untuk mengelola biaya saat"
" menggunakan Pay-As-You-Go Plan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah selanjutnya {#next-steps}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  -  [Manage cost](/guides/manage-cost) when using the Pay-As-You-Go Plan.\n"
"  -  Learn about the available [plans](/guides/plans-overview).\n"
"  -  Follow the steps in the [Run your first circuit on hardware](/guides/hello-world) guide to write and run a quantum program.\n"
"  -  Try a [tutorial](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Rekomendasi\">\n"
"  -  [Kelola biaya](/guides/manage-cost) saat menggunakan Pay-As-You-Go Plan.\n"
"  -  Pelajari tentang [paket-paket](/guides/plans-overview) yang tersedia.\n"
"  -  Ikuti langkah-langkah di [Hello world](/guides/hello-world) untuk menulis dan menjalankan program quantum.\n"
"  -  Coba sebuah [tutorial](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
